sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant H as Web host
    participant R as Agent Runner
    participant P as PostgreSQL

    B->>B: Prompt for explicit confirmation
    opt User confirms Delete chat
        B->>H: POST /forge/v1/dispatch<br/>Forge-Destination: ide.chat.history.delete<br/>Chat ID and expected revision
        H->>H: Check session, origin and CSRF
        H->>R: POST /v1/dispatch<br/>Bearer + same destination<br/>DeleteChatRequest
        R->>P: ChatHistoryDao write transaction<br/>Lock chat and check revision
        alt Current revision and chat exists
            P->>P: Remove transcript<br/>and write tombstone atomically
            P-->>R: Commit tombstone with new revision
            R-->>H: chat_history_deleted
            H-->>B: 200 · remove chat from the list
        else Missing chat or revision changed
            P-->>R: Leave history unchanged
            R-->>H: 404 · unavailable / 409 · conflict
            H-->>B: Refresh history before another edit
        end
    end
    Note over R,P: The tombstone blocks delayed writes<br/>from recreating deleted history
